# 5. STORY: MISTERI KOTAK HILANG

The story takes place in a fictional Malaysian school.

A blue box containing art materials has been misplaced after an art activity.

The pupil becomes Detektif Cilik and must investigate where the box was left.

The story must remain consistent from beginning to end.

