"Ali membawa kotak biru keluar dari bilik darjah selepas kelas seni."

Clue 2:
"Selepas melalui kantin, Ali pergi ke perpustakaan."

Clue 3:
"Kotak biru diletakkan di sebelah rak buku."

The final solution is:

**Kotak biru berada di sebelah rak buku di perpustakaan.**

Do not introduce contradictory clues.

Do not reveal the complete solution before the final investigation.

The pupil should gradually discover the information through interactive activities.

All story characters and events are fictional educational content.

